       display-size lead. At the old widths that lead broke after two or three
       words and read as chopped. Headroom checked against the footage: with
       inline 72-74 the panel's left edge lands around x=660 at 1280, and the
       bottles never reach past ~400, so there is room. */
    { inline: 50, block: 50, align: "center", width: 620 }, // 1 — empty dark frame: safe to centre
    { inline: 72, block: 46, align: "right",  width: 530 }, // 2 — products entering centre-left
    { inline: 74, block: 48, align: "right",  width: 560 }, // 3 — products centre-left
    { inline: 73, block: 50, align: "right",  width: 560 }, // 4 — products centre-left
