       darkSceneOpacity   -> strength at the START   (dark water)
       midSceneOpacity    -> strength in the MIDDLE
       brightSceneOpacity -> strength at the END     (bright final frame)
       dimStart/dimMid/dimEnd -> the progress points those three refer to
       gradientWidth/Height   -> size of the soft patch, as % of the screen.
