     E. PER-CHAPTER DIM MULTIPLIER
     Fine-tune ONE chapter without darkening the others. 1.0 = no change,
     1.15 = 15% more shade behind that chapter only, 0.9 = 10% less.
     Useful for the final chapter, which sits on the brightest frame.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
  var DESKTOP_DIM_MULTIPLIER = [0.90, 1.00, 1.00, 1.08, 1.15];
  var MOBILE_DIM_MULTIPLIER  = [1.00, 1.00, 1.05, 1.10, 1.15];

